{% extends '@EasyAdmin/page/content.html.twig' %}
{% form_theme form with ['@EasyAdmin/crud/form_theme.html.twig'] only %}
{% block content_title %}Upload statement{% endblock %}
{% block main %}
    <p>Maximum 10 MiB. Select the account or card that owns this statement. Set its currency and instrument kind in Sources first.</p>
    <p>Processing sends representative CSV rows and transaction details to <strong>{{ providerUrl }}</strong> using Jev. This is separate from your chat provider. Private descriptions, dates and amounts can leave this installation. Uploaded bytes remain in private local storage.</p>
    <p>Digital PDF and XLSX files are converted locally with MarkItDown, then their converted text is sent to your connected ChatGPT account for extraction using the fixed GPT-6 Luna / medium trial selection. This selection is independent of your chat settings and does not use chat history or tools. Jev then classifies the extracted rows. Connect ChatGPT before uploading PDF/XLSX. Scanned PDF/OCR support is not established.</p>
    <p>Use UTF-8 comma-separated CSV with separate unsigned debit/credit columns. Number formatting is detected from the file, independently of your display preferences. Dates may include a time; YYYY-MM-DD avoids day/month ambiguity. Processing creates drafts only; nothing is automatically approved or included in financial analysis.</p>
    {{ form_start(form) }}
        {{ form_errors(form) }}
        {{ form_row(form.source) }}
        {{ form_row(form.file) }}
        {{ form_row(form.providerConsent) }}
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Upload and prepare drafts</button>
    {{ form_end(form) }}
{% endblock %}
